# Results: keep the small summary files (CSV, TXT, MD) of every run, not its raw logs (several GB).
**/results/**/logs/
**/results/*/*.log
**/results/*/cp-*/
**/results/*/.*
**/results/smoke*/
**/results/aborted-*/
# stdout of the drivers, completion markers and the queue scripts that launched the runs: not needed
**/results/*.log
**/results/*.out
**/results/*.done
**/results/*-queue.sh
# the rogue-node and pool logs of the outsider runs are small and are the evidence: keep them
!**/outsider/results/*/*.log
# Aiken build outputs (rebuilt by p0-aiken.sh; aiken.lock IS kept) and demo outboxes of the gateway program
**/gateway-registry/build/
**/gateway-registry/plutus.json
**/gateway-registry/plutus-applied.json
**/pipeline/outbox*/
